DELETE /wiki/api/v2/databases/{id}
Delete a database by id. Deleting a database moves the database to the trash, where it can be restored later **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the database and its corresponding space. Permission to delete databases in the space.
Required: id (path) — The ID of the database to be deleted.

DELETE /wiki/api/v2/databases/{database-id}/properties/{property-id}
Deletes a content property for a database by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the database.
Required: database-id (path) — The ID of the database the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be deleted.

GET /wiki/api/v2/databases/{database-id}/properties/{property-id}
Retrieves a specific Content Property by ID that is attached to a specified database. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the database.
Required: database-id (path) — The ID of the database for which content properties should be returned.; property-id (path) — The ID of the content property being requested.

PUT /wiki/api/v2/databases/{database-id}/properties/{property-id}
Update a content property for a database by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the database.
Required: database-id (path) — The ID of the database the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be updated.; body (body) — The content property to be updated.
